<title>USA: REEARCH ALERT - Aware upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>REEARCH ALERT - Aware upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth Inc said Friday it upgraded its recommendation on Aware Inc to buy from neutral based on a move by U.S. Robotics Corp, a modem manufacturer, to use the company's DMT (Discrete Multitone) version in a line of Asymmetric Digital Subscriber Line modems expected to be introduced next year.</p>
<p>--There are no immediate revenues attached to the expected endorsement, Dain Bosworth said, &quot;so for the moment we are attaching a 'speculative' label to our upgrade.&quot;</p>
<p>--Aware ended up 3-5/16 at 12-1/16.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
